  "description": "Simone Biles earned about 11 million dollars in 2025 with no prize money, all from brand deals.\n\nSources:\n- Essence (Sportico list of highest-paid women athletes, 2025): https://www.essence.com/entertainment/sports/highest-paid-black-women-athletes-2025\n- Wikipedia: Simone Biles: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Simone_Biles\n\nFrom Essence: Sportico's 2025 list of the highest-paid women athletes has gymnast Simone Biles as the only non-tennis player in the top 15; she had no prize money in 2025, and endorsements brought her 2025 earnings to $11 million. From Wikipedia: she first tried gymnastics at age 6 on a day-care field trip; she has 11 Olympic medals and 30 World Championship medals, the most decorated gymnast in history. Not financial advice.\n\n#shorts #simonebiles #gymnastics #howtheymakemoney",
